@startuml
title AdScale — HA, failover и восстановление
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

node "Availability Zone A" {
  database "PostgreSQL primary" as pgp
  component "Redis primary shard(s)" as rp
  queue "Kafka broker 1" as k1
  database "ClickHouse replica 1" as ch1
}

node "Availability Zone B" {
  database "PostgreSQL standby" as pgs
  component "Redis replica shard(s)" as rr
  queue "Kafka broker 2" as k2
  database "ClickHouse replica 2" as ch2
}

node "Availability Zone C" {
  component "Consensus / failover\nPatroni DCS / managed control plane" as dcs
  queue "Kafka broker 3" as k3
  component "ClickHouse Keeper 3-node quorum" as keeper
}

cloud "Cross-account / cross-region\nimmutable object storage" as backup
component "Restore drill\nisolated environment" as restore

pgp --> pgs : streaming replication\nsync for Finance critical commits
dcs ..> pgp : health + fencing
dcs ..> pgs : promote after quorum
rp --> rr : cache replication
k1 <--> k2 : topic replication RF=3
k2 <--> k3 : topic replication RF=3
k3 <--> k1 : topic replication RF=3
ch1 <--> ch2 : ReplicatedMergeTree
keeper ..> ch1
keeper ..> ch2

pgp --> backup : base backup + WAL\nPITR
ch1 --> backup : incremental backup
k1 --> backup : raw events + topic config\n(Kafka replication != backup)
backup --> restore : scheduled restore
restore -> restore : verify checksums,\nconstraints and business invariants

note right of pgs
Standby/replica не является backup:
ошибочное удаление реплицируется.
Перед promotion старый primary fencing обязателен.
end note

note bottom of backup
Redis восстанавливается из SoT и прогревается.
Finance: ledger/balance — PostgreSQL; Kafka/Redis не SoT.
Фактические RPO/RTO подтверждаются restore drill и game day.
end note

@enduml
